{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>Ho.</b> Like oy, for those who go down to Egypt who did not see this salvation and went to escape, and there they will die." "<b>And did not look.</b> That they did not let themselves rely on HaShem, from the root שעו מני (Isaiah 22:4), and one who says that שעו is deficient a nun is incorrect."], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 31, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:56:10.158606607Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}